    "body": "Implementation update: the live partial-bounty trace showed shop_post_office running, SHOP_MENU flickering briefly, no item-list context, and no bounty mutation. I integrated a Receive Mail guard that arms only from Post Office INPUT_SHOP_BUY, survives the vanilla UI/control transition for 3.5 seconds, pauses mod-owned inventory/shop writes, and logs the real ready-delivery queue without modifying mail/save data. Combined release build passes and is queued for verified install. Keeping actionable until installed and Receive Mail is tested.",
